CHR-FR-11 - Socket callbacks re-throw on thread-pool threads, which terminates the service process when the HSM is unreachable [Blocker] Location: Utilidades\AsynchronousClient.cs:127-141, 158-172, 189-221 (throw; at :141, 172, 221), plus the constructor doing all I/O (:50) and throw new Exception(ex.Message) (:102).
